WEBVTT

00:02.477 --> 00:06.277
<i>I'm sure no one would believe it.</i>

00:09.237 --> 00:12.457
Nice to meet you, members 
of the council of elders.

00:12.457 --> 00:14.367
My name is Subaru Natsuki.

00:14.367 --> 00:18.207
I am a manservant in Roswaal's mansion, 
and I serve as this candidate's...

00:18.207 --> 00:21.137
Lady Emilia's best knight!

02:03.477 --> 02:05.727
I ain't got no name to give.

02:06.307 --> 02:07.847
I'm just...

02:07.847 --> 02:09.407
a stick swinger.

02:21.307 --> 02:23.007
The hell's your deal?

02:23.007 --> 02:26.207
Throwin' a sword at me? 
You got a death wish?

02:27.007 --> 02:31.717
To attack an unarmed man is an act 
that would disgrace any knight.

02:31.987 --> 02:34.687
Hah! Don't make me laugh!

02:35.407 --> 02:38.727
I hope you do not
come to regret those words!

02:43.087 --> 02:45.847
You thought I was unarmed?

02:45.847 --> 02:47.857
Look closer.

02:49.187 --> 02:51.027
Wooden... sticks?

02:51.027 --> 02:53.617
No, you idiot. They're chopsticks.

02:53.617 --> 02:56.407
I keep 'em on me in case 
I need a little snack.

02:56.877 --> 03:00.087
If I swing 'em just the right way,

03:00.087 --> 03:04.457
at just the right angle and 
just the right speed...

03:04.457 --> 03:08.957
there's nothing I can't cut 
through, even with chopsticks!

03:32.947 --> 03:33.487
Julius!

03:33.487 --> 03:34.317
Jiwaldo!

03:39.107 --> 03:43.117
My sword can even
cut through light, y'know!

03:43.117 --> 03:44.247
Jiwaldo!

03:56.817 --> 03:58.537
Jiwaldo! Jiwaldo!

03:58.887 --> 04:00.557
You gotta aim better!

04:01.157 --> 04:04.307
You'll never get your 
pretty boy back that way!

04:04.307 --> 04:07.367
Jiwaldo! Jiwaldo! Jiwaldo!

04:07.367 --> 04:09.867
Jiwaldo! Jiwaldo!

04:10.997 --> 04:12.187
Lady Anastasia!

04:12.737 --> 04:13.897
That's enough!

04:14.407 --> 04:15.727
Jiwal...

04:19.147 --> 04:21.197
Lady Anastasia!

04:26.607 --> 04:29.167
You're just my kinda guy right now!

04:29.167 --> 04:31.627
You're gettin' me excited!

04:33.287 --> 04:34.507
Move aside!

04:45.727 --> 04:47.417
The hell is this?

04:47.417 --> 04:49.647
Don't make me laugh, man.

04:49.647 --> 04:53.527
If this is the best ya got, 
you're a real disappointment.

04:53.527 --> 04:55.567
You're boring me!

04:56.167 --> 04:57.487
I am...

04:57.487 --> 05:00.447
If you wanna get to that 
woman, I'll let ya go.

05:00.447 --> 05:04.037
Crawl into her nice, soft lap 
to cry and beg for attention,

05:04.037 --> 05:07.747
you ugly, useless excuse for a knight!

05:13.227 --> 05:14.207
Take a nap.

05:23.547 --> 05:24.767
Now...

05:25.187 --> 05:26.227
who's next?

05:28.377 --> 05:30.687
I'd just like to ask one question.

05:31.207 --> 05:33.687
Didn't we just need to 
make you move one step?

05:34.117 --> 05:35.717
You were running around lots.

05:35.717 --> 05:37.377
Don't take that at face value.

05:37.377 --> 05:39.777
I just said it to sound cool.

05:39.777 --> 05:41.487
You get it, don't ya?

05:41.487 --> 05:44.617
I guess not, you bein' a woman and all.

05:44.617 --> 05:48.327
A real hottie, too. You 
should go out with me.

05:48.327 --> 05:51.127
I'm sorry. I don't understand 
what you're saying.

05:51.127 --> 05:54.877
Also, I don't think I 
could beat you in a fight.

05:54.877 --> 05:56.717
E-Emilia?

05:58.327 --> 06:00.247
You seem very strong.

06:00.247 --> 06:02.067
I could see that by watching you.

06:02.547 --> 06:05.767
But we have to get past this exam.

06:06.077 --> 06:08.727
So please give us a way to win.

06:10.177 --> 06:13.017
If I can make you take
even one step, we win.

06:13.607 --> 06:15.227
That'll be our contest.

06:16.257 --> 06:17.007
No?

06:18.697 --> 06:22.077
Damn, nice! I actually don't hate that!

06:22.077 --> 06:24.497
You're the biggest idiot 
I've seen since Tricia!

06:24.497 --> 06:25.697
I like you!

06:26.117 --> 06:30.017
Fine. If you make me take
one step, you win.

06:31.467 --> 06:34.087
Take care of the two of them.

06:34.367 --> 06:36.797
H-Hang on! You saw him just now!

06:36.797 --> 06:37.947
You need a plan for—

06:37.947 --> 06:39.397
Icebrand Arts.

06:47.007 --> 06:48.297
Icicle Line.

06:50.327 --> 06:53.187
Don't worry.
I'll take this seriously, too.

06:53.187 --> 06:56.817
You're pretty stubborn for such a hottie.

06:57.217 --> 06:59.447
I do what I can, the best I can.

06:59.447 --> 07:02.697
That's how I learned to do 
things... from my knight!

07:25.207 --> 07:27.747
They're both all right, I suppose. But...

07:27.747 --> 07:28.997
I know.

07:34.177 --> 07:35.677
He's not moving.

08:20.147 --> 08:21.607
You're open!

08:26.727 --> 08:27.277
Wha—

08:28.597 --> 08:30.527
Perks of fighting a hottie.

08:30.527 --> 08:33.117
Don't get mad over a little thing like—

08:44.617 --> 08:45.757
Ow!

08:45.757 --> 08:48.007
Wh-What the hell are you thinkin'?!

08:48.007 --> 08:50.717
Most chicks would lose their edge 
after bein' touched like that!

08:51.037 --> 08:54.087
Huh? But all you did was touch me.

08:54.087 --> 08:55.597
I mean, you were wide open.

08:55.597 --> 08:58.647
Oh, screw you! How the hell 
were you brought up, anyway?!

08:58.647 --> 09:00.647
What were your parents thinkin'?!

09:00.647 --> 09:02.417
Did I say something strange?

09:02.417 --> 09:04.817
Yo! Do somethin' about this woman!

09:04.817 --> 09:06.147
Don't let her go outside!

09:06.147 --> 09:07.577
You're her attendant, aren't ya?!

09:07.577 --> 09:11.377
Screw <i>you</i>, you prick!
What are you trying to pull?!

09:11.377 --> 09:14.177
You pervert! Shitbag! Sin Archbishop!

09:14.177 --> 09:15.697
I will end you!

09:14.177 --> 09:16.567
Subaru! Calm down!

09:16.567 --> 09:18.997
I understand how you feel, 
but look, I suppose!

09:21.197 --> 09:23.847
He moved! And more than just one step!

09:23.847 --> 09:25.297
Oh! You're right!

09:25.297 --> 09:27.757
I did it! I won!

09:27.757 --> 09:30.467
A win is a win, no matter how it happened.

09:31.197 --> 09:33.057
So what now?

09:33.567 --> 09:35.847
Well, that's how it goes.

09:35.847 --> 09:37.767
I said what I said.

09:37.767 --> 09:39.977
Wait, you're admitting it?

09:39.977 --> 09:43.467
Just who the hell do you think I am?

09:43.467 --> 09:47.487
If I refuse to back down now, 
it's just gonna make me look bad.

09:47.847 --> 09:52.317
After the way you just lost, 
you couldn't look any worse.

09:52.317 --> 09:54.207
Shut yer trap, wuss!

09:54.207 --> 09:56.957
Anyway, the hottie wins.

09:56.957 --> 09:58.767
I'll let you pass.

09:58.767 --> 10:00.697
It is what it is.

10:06.177 --> 10:09.667
Well? Is the wuss gonna do the next one?

10:10.727 --> 10:13.927
Or is it gonna be one of the two brats?

10:14.557 --> 10:17.137
There are seven inside the tower.

10:17.637 --> 10:21.097
Your woman here is the 
first one to make it out.

10:21.447 --> 10:22.307
Huh?

10:22.717 --> 10:26.737
So who's gonna be next to get past me?

10:27.267 --> 10:29.507
Well, bro?

10:30.887 --> 10:33.827
So you came running back dejected?

10:34.227 --> 10:36.787
Harsh, Big Sister.

10:36.787 --> 10:38.987
Stop talking like that.

10:38.987 --> 10:42.497
You'll make that sleeping girl's story 
about you being her master feel real.

10:42.497 --> 10:45.487
Yikes, wouldn't want that.
I'll be careful.

10:45.487 --> 10:46.817
So it was a crushing defeat.

10:46.817 --> 10:50.407
Only Lady Emilia could measure up to him.

10:50.407 --> 10:51.887
Yes, I won.

10:52.367 --> 10:54.067
Maybe I should go up alone?

10:54.067 --> 10:56.457
No, I don't think that's a good idea.

10:56.457 --> 10:59.137
It's, well... you know... dangerous.

10:59.527 --> 11:01.227
I'll be very careful.

11:01.227 --> 11:02.227
Dangerous.

11:02.227 --> 11:03.317
Dangerous.

11:03.317 --> 11:04.227
Dangerous indeed.

11:06.167 --> 11:09.947
I just hope Julius isn't feeling too down.

11:10.327 --> 11:11.327
You're worried?

11:11.957 --> 11:12.907
Hard to say.

11:13.367 --> 11:16.117
I mean, sure, I'm worried about him...

11:16.847 --> 11:19.217
but it's not that simple, you know?

11:20.797 --> 11:21.787
Also...

11:22.407 --> 11:26.887
why did she try so hard to help Julius?

11:26.887 --> 11:30.757
I'm concerned for them, 
but the exam is important, too.

11:31.187 --> 11:34.467
If we don't get past it, we won't 
find a way to get Rem back.

11:34.777 --> 11:38.947
To be completely honest, that 
examiner was insanely strong.

11:38.947 --> 11:41.007
Maybe even on Reinhard's level.

11:41.007 --> 11:43.437
Yeah. I think he was just that strong.

11:43.867 --> 11:46.967
Right now, there's only one person 
in each nation who's strong enough

11:46.967 --> 11:48.937
to be called the best in the world.

11:49.217 --> 11:51.947
Reinhard's the strongest in the kingdom...

11:51.947 --> 11:55.237
so there's one like him in each 
of the other three countries, too?

11:57.357 --> 11:59.497
The top general of the Vollachia Empire,

11:59.497 --> 12:02.467
the "Blue Lightning," Cecils Segmund.

12:03.607 --> 12:06.587
The "Mad Prince" of the 
Holy Kingdom of Gusteco.

12:07.277 --> 12:10.967
And the city-state of Kararagi 
has the "Admirer," Halibel.

12:11.547 --> 12:14.257
None of them fit the description 
of the stick swinger.

12:14.257 --> 12:18.007
His outfit resembled the traditional 
attire of Kararagi, I suppose.

12:18.007 --> 12:20.017
He was also a master at using chopsticks.

12:20.017 --> 12:22.497
I'm not sure you could call him a master.

12:22.497 --> 12:25.307
That's not even how chopsticks are used.

12:24.147 --> 12:27.267
Hey, you guys... Got a minute?

12:31.227 --> 12:35.537
Master... Don't leave me alone...

12:35.537 --> 12:37.947
I don't want to be lonely anymore...

12:37.947 --> 12:41.067
Don't say sad stuff when 
we're just about to leave!

12:41.067 --> 12:43.457
You're totally awake, aren't you?

12:43.457 --> 12:44.917
Boo.

12:47.607 --> 12:51.667
Huh? What are you guys doing here?

12:51.667 --> 12:56.977
Last thing I remember was Master's flash
of insight getting us past the exam...

12:56.977 --> 12:57.727
Is this a dream?

12:57.727 --> 12:58.637
It's real.

12:59.557 --> 13:04.877
Well, then Master hugged me and said, 
laughing, "I won't let you go again."

13:04.877 --> 13:06.017
<i>That's</i> a dream!

13:06.347 --> 13:09.777
You passed out the moment 
the second exam started.

13:09.777 --> 13:12.167
Passed out? Me?

13:12.167 --> 13:15.397
I'd never do anything that pathetic!

13:15.397 --> 13:17.447
You don't remember?

13:17.447 --> 13:20.277
We went up that long stairway 
and into a white room...

13:20.777 --> 13:21.737
Uh-huh.

13:21.737 --> 13:25.497
Then, when I pulled out the sword, the 
scenery changed, and a person appeared...

13:25.957 --> 13:27.457
Uh-huh.

13:27.457 --> 13:32.377
A guy with red hair and blue eyes who 
called himself a "stick swinger."

13:32.807 --> 13:36.627
Ow! Ow, ow, ow! You remember now?!

13:36.627 --> 13:39.687
Wh-Wh-What is he doing here?!

13:39.687 --> 13:44.407
He's alive! He really is 
a guy you just can't kill!

13:44.407 --> 13:46.427
Huh?! What are you—

13:45.247 --> 13:46.427
"Stick swinger"!

13:46.427 --> 13:47.927
Reid the Stick Swinger!

13:47.927 --> 13:49.937
That brute! That devil!

13:49.937 --> 13:54.497
He came back alive just so 
he could fondle my boobs!

13:55.207 --> 13:58.407
Reid? Wasn't Reid the guy who...

13:59.207 --> 14:00.497
Reid Astrea.

14:01.097 --> 14:02.617
The first Sword Saint.

14:06.197 --> 14:08.537
Julius, sorry to bug you 
when you're asleep.

14:09.147 --> 14:12.207
We figured out who that guy 
was, and we need your...

14:14.247 --> 14:16.257
That idiot!

14:23.127 --> 14:28.597
We're not just playin'
around this time, bro.

14:30.557 --> 14:35.067
I am Julius Juukulius of the 
Lugunica Imperial Knights.

14:35.067 --> 14:38.327
So long as you keep throwin' 
around that stupid title,

14:38.327 --> 14:40.737
you're not even worth my
time to play with.

14:51.397 --> 14:52.627
Boring!

14:52.627 --> 14:54.997
Playing exactly by the book, aren't ya?!

15:01.927 --> 15:03.047
There ya go!

15:12.397 --> 15:15.777
Hmph! Damn, you're pathetic.

15:15.777 --> 15:18.407
How long have you been using a sword, anyway?

15:18.407 --> 15:22.327
It's only been three 
months for me, y'know.

15:34.327 --> 15:38.267
I... will defeat you... right here and—

15:38.267 --> 15:40.067
Don't be dumb.

15:40.067 --> 15:41.757
You really think you can?

15:42.027 --> 15:44.887
You can't. Not you.

15:48.367 --> 15:51.727
You won't swing that sword enough 
to reach me! You haven't yet!

15:51.727 --> 15:54.097
You're not good enough!

15:54.397 --> 15:57.227
This is no place for you!

15:57.227 --> 16:01.437
You're the wrong actor for this 
scene! Nobody invited you!

16:06.977 --> 16:09.827
Nobody's watching a loser like you.

16:09.827 --> 16:11.997
Nobody expects anything of you.

16:12.397 --> 16:16.297
Don't get complacent thinkin' 
I'm just playin' around!

16:21.817 --> 16:24.387
Damn, you withstood that?

16:24.387 --> 16:26.887
You're just gettin' more and more boring.

16:39.367 --> 16:42.067
Right now...

16:43.857 --> 16:45.407
this strength...

16:48.167 --> 16:49.897
is the only thing I...

16:52.657 --> 16:56.037
Your hesitation's showing in
your sword work.

16:57.277 --> 16:59.787
You're not worthy of the heavenly sword.

17:00.607 --> 17:04.837
You can't even manage to be a follower.

17:16.897 --> 17:19.437
My eyes know just how strong you are!

17:19.647 --> 17:21.437
My humiliation knows it!

17:21.897 --> 17:24.147
No matter who else may forget!

17:25.447 --> 17:27.067
Julius!

18:03.977 --> 18:06.527
It's... very shaky...

18:06.527 --> 18:08.527
Oh, you're awake?

18:08.907 --> 18:11.707
I'm on your back?

18:11.707 --> 18:13.147
That's right.

18:13.147 --> 18:16.177
Just so you know, this is the 
second time in not very long.

18:16.177 --> 18:18.907
Do you know how it feels 
to be doing this again

18:18.907 --> 18:22.637
thirty minutes after saying I 
never wanted to do it again?

18:22.637 --> 18:25.707
No wonder I feel so uncomfortable.

18:25.707 --> 18:28.167
You want me to drop you?

18:39.737 --> 18:42.687
Will Lady Anastasia be all right?

18:42.687 --> 18:44.867
Her life's not in danger.

18:44.867 --> 18:47.697
You came a lot closer
to death than she did.

18:47.697 --> 18:49.027
Up against him...

18:49.627 --> 18:53.917
You know, you're gonna be shocked when 
you find out who that eyepatch guy was.

18:52.417 --> 18:53.917
Reid Astrea.

18:54.407 --> 18:56.437
Good on you for knowing.

18:56.437 --> 18:58.357
I had to learn it from Shaula.

18:58.357 --> 19:02.017
I had a hunch the moment he called 
himself a "stick swinger,"

19:02.017 --> 19:03.917
but I couldn't be certain.

19:03.917 --> 19:05.947
I'm sorry I couldn't tell you.

19:05.947 --> 19:06.897
It's fine.

19:12.647 --> 19:13.467
Julius...

19:14.757 --> 19:18.827
I'm gonna tell you this since you'll 
find out when we get back anyway.

19:18.827 --> 19:21.367
After you and Lady Anastasia went down,

19:21.367 --> 19:23.637
Emilia passed the exam.

19:24.647 --> 19:29.447
But it wasn't like she matched her 
opponent in strength or anything.

19:29.447 --> 19:31.887
She just had a lot of coincidences 
line up in her favor,

19:31.887 --> 19:35.117
plus Emilia is just...
you know... special.

19:35.487 --> 19:39.577
So... I mean... don't get too excited.

19:40.647 --> 19:41.787
Excited?

19:42.247 --> 19:45.027
If Lady Emilia was able to pass the exam,

19:45.027 --> 19:48.437
then Reid the Sword Saint is 
not an insurmountable obstacle.

19:48.437 --> 19:50.727
That knowledge alone helps us immensely.

19:50.727 --> 19:54.507
Y-Yeah, you're right. That's true.

19:55.117 --> 19:57.277
So long as you realize that.

19:59.217 --> 20:02.297
Would you mind letting me down now?

20:02.297 --> 20:05.977
I fear I'll get sick if I have 
to ride on your back any longer.

20:06.287 --> 20:10.297
Emilia would kill me if she found out 
I made you walk while you're hurt.

20:10.297 --> 20:12.647
I'm awake. I can go
down these stairs myself.

20:12.647 --> 20:14.487
Little late for the tough act now.

20:14.487 --> 20:17.857
Everyone already saw me
carrying you earlier.

20:17.857 --> 20:21.367
Except Shaula and Lady Anastasia, 
that is, since they were unconscious.

20:21.367 --> 20:23.427
Then that will be my reason.

20:23.427 --> 20:25.427
I can't let Lady Anastasia see—

20:25.427 --> 20:27.677
Don't make it sound so forced.

20:27.677 --> 20:28.687
Put me down.

20:28.687 --> 20:30.877
You know, you—

20:30.877 --> 20:32.297
I said put me down!

20:32.297 --> 20:34.317
Whoa, hey! Hang on!

20:39.757 --> 20:41.287
You...

20:41.287 --> 20:43.477
You idiot! What are you even thinking?!

20:43.477 --> 20:44.727
Stay away!

20:48.317 --> 20:49.647
I can stand on my own.

20:51.897 --> 20:53.937
I do not need...

20:56.067 --> 20:57.057
your help!

21:08.027 --> 21:09.727
I told you.

21:10.447 --> 21:13.927
Standing up on my own is a simple matter.

21:15.297 --> 21:20.677
I may be a bit slow, but there's no 
need to put you through any trouble.

21:21.407 --> 21:25.137
Could you go on ahead and tell 
the others what happened?

21:25.727 --> 21:28.317
I will explain things to them myself.

21:28.317 --> 21:33.507
You need only tell them that you found me.

21:36.817 --> 21:39.667
Oh, damn it! Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

21:39.667 --> 21:43.537
Idiots! You and I are both huge idiots!

21:44.217 --> 21:45.097
What are you—

21:45.097 --> 21:47.877
Shut up! You can stand
on your own, my ass!

21:47.877 --> 21:50.747
I can plainly see how
hunched over you are!

21:51.147 --> 21:53.877
You knew before that fight was over 
that you couldn't win, didn't you?

21:54.317 --> 21:56.817
He beat you, kicked you,
knocked you down...

21:56.817 --> 21:59.487
and you still had no choice but 
to keep going after him, right?!

21:59.487 --> 22:02.597
There was no other way to 
get it out of your system!

22:03.147 --> 22:07.347
Thanks to a certain someone, I 
understand that damn well by now!

22:13.177 --> 22:18.567
I won't talk as if I know how 
you really feel deep down.

22:18.567 --> 22:22.487
But right now, there's no need for you

22:22.487 --> 22:27.997
to try to get down this 
long-ass stairway alone.

22:27.997 --> 22:31.707
I can spare a shoulder for you, and 
I won't even think of it as a favor.

22:32.877 --> 22:35.297
Back then, I...

22:36.237 --> 22:41.387
So I'm not gonna let you 
go down these stairs alone!

22:49.877 --> 22:50.877
Subaru.

22:51.337 --> 22:52.327
What?

22:53.607 --> 22:54.707
I'm sorry.

22:56.017 --> 22:57.207
Shut up.

23:04.407 --> 23:05.617
<i>I'm sure</i>

23:07.947 --> 23:10.107
<i>no one would believe it.</i>

23:11.307 --> 23:17.377
<i>The blowhard who made enemies of everyone 
in the castle's great hall that day...</i>

23:18.107 --> 23:19.797
<i>Even the very man who said it</i>

23:20.357 --> 23:22.397
<i>couldn't hide his frivolous attitude</i>

23:22.397 --> 23:25.757
<i>or the fact that he was riding 
on momentum when he said it.</i>

23:27.447 --> 23:28.627
<i>No one...</i>

23:31.727 --> 23:32.697
<i>No one...</i>

23:33.557 --> 23:35.057
<i>would believe</i>

23:35.057 --> 23:40.067
<b>Julius Juukulius</b>

23:36.347 --> 23:39.297
<i>there was someone in that hall 
who was deeply moved by that.</i>
